{title: Glory, Halleluj}

{comment: Chorus}
Glory, Halleluj, this is what we come to do
Tear down strongholds, break the chains
Bind the devil in Jesus name
Tonight, we got a right to shake the foundation with praise

{comment: Bridge}
Praise Him, Praise Him
The Lord is worthy, the Lord is worthy
The Lord is worthy, the Lord is worthy
Tonight, we got a right to shake the foundation with praise
